      "title": "How often do actions fail?",
      "description": "Share of action.dart runs that threw. Good: under 1 %. If not: Actions lists the failing action and Errors its error type; check its validate() and the server's answer.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "fespalier-openobserve"
      },
      "gridPos": {
